        return `M${cx},${y} L${cx + headW * w},${y + tip * h} L${cx + stem * w},${y + tip * h} L${cx + stem * w},${cy - stem * h} L${x2 + w - tip * w},${cy - stem * h} L${x2 + w - tip * w},${cy - headW * h} L${x2 + w},${cy} L${x2 + w - tip * w},${cy + headW * h} L${x2 + w - tip * w},${cy + stem * h} L${cx + stem * w},${cy + stem * h} L${cx + stem * w},${y + h - tip * h} L${cx + headW * w},${y + h - tip * h} L${cx},${y + h} L${cx - headW * w},${y + h - tip * h} L${cx - stem * w},${y + h - tip * h} L${cx - stem * w},${cy + stem * h} L${x2 + tip * w},${cy + stem * h} L${x2 + tip * w},${cy + headW * h} L${x2},${cy} L${x2 + tip * w},${cy - headW * h} L${x2 + tip * w},${cy - stem * h} L${cx - stem * w},${cy - stem * h} L${cx - stem * w},${y + tip * h} L${cx - headW * w},${y + tip * h} Z`;
